    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Activates the Entrance Animation when there is a \"Saiyan Saga\"\nor \"Planet Namek Saga\" Category enemy or a \"Saiyan Saga\" or\n\"Planet Namek Saga\" Category ally on the team (self excluded)\nat the start of the character's attacking turn*\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}Chance of evading enemy's attack 40%{passiveImg:up_g} and\nall allies' ATK & DEF 40%{passiveImg:up_g} for 40 turns\n*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Medium chance of evading enemy's attack\n*When there is an enemy or an ally whose name includes \"Goku\"\n(Youth, Captain Ginyu, Jr., etc. excluded)*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 10%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*Before receiving an attack within the turn*\n- Performs a critical hit\n- Damage reduction rate 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*After evading an attack*\n- Launches 2 additional Super Attacks\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every attack evaded*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 26%{passiveImg:up_g}",
